    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Με and μετρό",
     "texto": [
      "**Πάω** means I go. To say «I'm going to Athens», you say **πάω στην Αθήνα**. For other destinations, **πάω στο…**.",
      "**Με** means «with» or indicates the means of transport (like English «by»): **με λεωφορείο**, **με μετρό**, **με τρένο**. Learn the full expression for each type of transport."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
